<title>USA: Gateway to add 100 jobs in Kansas City.</title>
<headline>Gateway to add 100 jobs in Kansas City.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH SIOUX CITY, S.D. 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gateway 2000 Inc said it planned to begin a major-account sales operation at its existing Kansas City, Missouri, facility, adding about 100 new positions in the second quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>Dave Chamberlain, director of major accounts for Gateway, a direct marketer of personal computers, said its major-account sales operation in North Sioux City, South Dakota, would grow as well.</p>
<p>Major-account sales in 1996 generated about 35 percent of the company's total revenue, Gateway said.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
